arbonate_mg_per_l: 0.0,\n    43\t            chloride_mg_per_l: 0.0,\n    44\t            sulfate_mg_per_l: 0.0,\n    45\t        }\n    46\t    }\n    47\t}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
